# Migration checksums (scripts/migrate-plan.ts) are a raw SHA-256 over file
# bytes -- Windows checkouts with core.autocrlf=true silently rewrite these
# to CRLF, which drifts the checksum away from whatever was recorded when
# the file was first applied. Forcing LF here keeps the checksum stable
# across every contributor's OS.
migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
